  "wave 20 hulk 1 gap 1 delay 0; wave 20 ironskin 6 gap 1.2 delay 4; wave 20 frostling 12 gap 0.6 delay 8",
  "wave 21 shadow 8 gap 0.8 delay 0; wave 21 frostling 11 gap 0.6 delay 4",
